ideo Nakaizumi","role":"Akio's Brother","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xiZECCxGiGmaSE24moAmAUSfWDf.jpg"},{"id":1039245,"name":"Ryohei Abe","role":"Akio's Brother","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/anuf5P6XqCaxk4KzqYc0UPTZNsv.jpg"},{"id":1095950,"name":"Kazuma Yamane","role":"Mitsuko's Boyfriend","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u3DhiNcmU883wvzGgVU3FT9ZO8O.jpg"},{"id":1127063,"name":"Ichiro Hashimoto","role":"Akio's Brother","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/okW8rI4tWISvGvVd9GNzjYonhWF.jpg"},{"id":929306,"name":"Suwaru Ryû","role":"Akio's Brother"},{"id":1124205,"name":"Rina Saito","role":"Amazing Gold Employee","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9vBKZACWxrzhqReXKnHPtmmp1eB.jpg"},{"id":1039247,"name":"Lorena Koto","role":"Amazing Gold Employee","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o2Sd5mFF8Ge2QycavnvApQYRBFv.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Cold Fish","overview":"Shamoto gestisce un piccolo negozio di pesci tropicali. Quando sua fglia Mitsuko viene sorpresa a rubare in un negozio di alimentari un uomo di nome Murata interviene per sistemare le cose tra la ragazza e il negoziante. Anche Murata ha un negozio di pesci tropicali e diventa presto amico di Shamoto. Ma Murata nasconde molti oscuri segreti dietro la sua amichevole faccia."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Cold Fish","overview":"When fish shop owner Shamoto's teenage daughter Mitsuko is caught stealing, a generous middle-aged man named Murata helps resolve the situation. The man and his wife offer to have Mitsuko work at their opposing fish store. Shamoto soon discovers that something far more sinister lives behind Murata's friendly demeanor.","tagline":"He'll make you pick up the pieces."},{"language":"ja-JP","title":"冷たい熱帯魚","overview":"死別した前妻の娘と現在の妻。その折り合いの悪い二人に挟まれながらも、主人公の社本信行は小さな熱帯魚店を営んでいた。波風の立たないよう静かに暮らす小市民的気質の社本。だが、家族の確執に向き合わない彼の態度は、ついに娘の万引きを招く。スーパーでの万引き発覚で窮地に陥る社本だったが、そんな彼を救ったのはスーパー店長と懇意のある村田だった。村田の懇願により店長は万引きを許す。さらに大型熱帯魚店を経営する村田は、娘をバイトとして雇い入れる。その親切さと人の良さそうな男に誘われて、社本と村田夫婦との交流が始まる。しばらくして、利益の大きい高級魚の取引を持ちかけられる社本。それが、村田の悪逆非道な「ビジネス」を知り、同時に引き返せなくなる顛末への引き金となった。","tagline":"この素晴らしき世界。"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8jzXKuuSMNYU0jSakJkdkzQcZbL.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lCR2wcqu6BBF7vFF3TqqDartccO.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":68341,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"ja-JP","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/669GmEZsyMlPliURX5myHTStslv.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/669GmEZsyMlPliURX5myHTStslv.jpg","language":"en","width":1400,"height":2100},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/669GmEZsyMlPliURX5myHTStslv.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/669GmEZsyMlPliURX5myHTStslv.jpg","language":"en","width":1400,"height":2100},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yZ2jW612hufmG1HUUvundKCa9Yd.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yZ2jW612hufmG1HUUvundKCa9Yd.jpg","language":"en","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2GoKRzPRgMuDBozxOLQkf2oHQtu.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2GoKRzPRgMuDBozxOLQkf2oHQtu.jpg","language":"en","width":1067,"height":1600},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/25ksZ3U6FvvAQAD9v1WFCrpk9sJ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/25ksZ3U6FvvAQAD9v1WFCrpk9sJ.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1426},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uO0fLlIDyWsbLUigLG6dfUh8UJI.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uO0fLlIDyWsbLUigLG6dfUh8UJI.jpg","language":"en","width":1170,"height":1755},{"typ